# M11 "Künye": a fresh level-1 Aydor warrior opens the character sheet (C): nothing to spend, every
# "+" disabled, the tooltip of Güç. It hunts Kül Çömezi to level 2 (`scene hunt`, as the levelup
# flow): the level-up toast names the 3 new points, the Künye button carries the glowing marker.
# In the Künye it picks 2 Güç + 1 Dayanıklılık as pending points (gold "+2" / "+1", the derived
# values previewed with deriveStats), drops them with Vazgeç, picks them again and confirms (the
# once-per-session "geri alınamaz" question): the new base values and derived values come with
# CHAR_STATS. Esc order: Künye before the inventory. After going back to the character list and
# entering again the allocation is still there (the server stored it).
wait 5
waitfor login+idle 120
clickon login.username
text m11_stats
clickon login.password
text gizli123
key enter
waitfor charcreate+race+idle 900
clickon create.race.aydor
clickon create.next
waitfor charcreate+details 60
clickon create.class.1
clickon create.name
text Kunyeci
clickon create.submit
waitfor charselect+idle+chars1 900
clickon select.enter
waitfor world+ready+idle+invloaded+monsters+statsknown 1800
expect world+level1+unspent0+nopoints
key c
waitfor world+kunye 60
expect world+noadd+nopending
scene expectattr guc 12 0
scene expectattr dayaniklilik 11 0
scene expectunspent 0
scene expectderived maxhp 90
scene expectderived crit 5
scene expectderived dodge 2.4
expecttext kunye.unspent Dağıtılmamış puan: 0
expecttext kunye.class Seviye 1
expecttext kunye.derived Kaçınma %2,4
hoveron kunye.attr.strength
wait 5
expecttext kunye.tooltip Savaşçı olarak saldırı gücün bu niteliğe bağlı
screenshot 01_kunye_level1.png
key c
waitfor world+kunyeclosed 60
# ---- To level 2 ----
scene walktomonster Kül Çömezi 8
waitfor world+nodest+standing 2400
scene hunt Kül Çömezi 2
waitfor world+levelups1 9000
waitfor world+unspent3 120
expect world+level2+levelpoints+unspentmarker+points+canadd
wait 15
screenshot 02_level_up_points.png
# ---- Pending points, preview, Vazgeç ----
key c
waitfor world+kunye 60
expecttext kunye.unspent Dağıtılmamış puan: 3
clickon kunye.plus.strength
clickon kunye.plus.strength
clickon kunye.plus.vitality
waitfor world+kunye+pending 30
scene expectpending guc 2
scene expectpending dayaniklilik 1
scene expectunspent 3
scene expectpreview maxhp 115
expecttext kunye.attr.strength Güç 12 +2
expecttext kunye.attr.vitality Dayanıklılık 11 +1
expecttext kunye.derived Can 110 → 115
expecttext kunye.unspent seçilen: 3
expect world+noadd
# A right click on the row takes one back ("+" is disabled: no points left), "+" adds it again.
rclickon kunye.attr.vitality
waitfor world+kunye 10
scene expectpending dayaniklilik 0
clickon kunye.plus.vitality
scene expectpending dayaniklilik 1
hoveron kunye.attr.vitality
wait 5
screenshot 03_pending_preview.png
clickon kunye.cancel
waitfor world+nopending 30
scene expectpending guc 0
scene expectattr guc 12
scene expectunspent 3
expect world+canadd
# ---- Again, and confirm ----
clickon kunye.plus.strength
clickon kunye.plus.strength
clickon kunye.plus.vitality
waitfor world+pending 30
clickon kunye.confirm
waitfor world+modal 60
expecttext messagebox.text geri alınamaz
screenshot 04_confirm.png
clickon messagebox.button0
waitfor world+allocated1+statidle+nopending 600
scene expectattr guc 14 0
scene expectattr dayaniklilik 12 0
scene expectunspent 0
scene expectderived maxhp 115
scene expectstatmessage Puanlar dağıtıldı
expect world+noadd+nopoints
expecttext kunye.attr.strength Güç 14
scene statlog
# ---- Esc: the Künye closes before the inventory ----
key i
waitfor world+inv+kunye 60
wait 10
screenshot 05_allocated_with_inventory.png
key escape
waitfor world+kunyeclosed+inv 60
key escape
waitfor world+kunyeclosed+invclosed 60
# ---- Back to the character list and in again: the allocation was stored ----
scene target none
waitfor world+notarget 60
key escape
waitfor world+menu 60
clickon world.menu.charselect
waitfor charselect+idle+chars1 900
clickon select.enter
waitfor world+ready+idle+statsknown 1800
scene expectattr guc 14 0
scene expectattr dayaniklilik 12 0
scene expectunspent 0
expect world+level2+nopoints
key c
waitfor world+kunye 60
wait 10
screenshot 06_after_relog.png
quit
